{"ID":"20240205153850-phjx6tq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153850-phjx6tq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153850-phjx6tq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205155600-aktakyb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613100017-8jn3gy4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2115,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619190058-yap10y0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"290贯众","type":"doc","updated":"20240823135956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205155600-aktakyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155600-aktakyb","updated":"20240618113705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"绵马贯众"}]},{"ID":"20240206090605-r42o1ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206090605-r42o1ud","updated":"20240206090608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产内蒙古、东北、河北、甘肃等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈长倒卵形，略弯曲上端钝圆或截形，下端较尖，有的纵剖为两半，长720cm，直径48cm。表面黄棕色至黑褐色，密被排列整齐的叶柄残基及鳞片，并有弯曲的须根。叶柄残基呈扁圆形，长35cm，直径0.51.0cm；表面有纵棱线，质硬而脆，断面略平坦，棕色，有黄白色维管束513 个，环列；每个叶柄残基的外侧常有3条须根，鳞片条状披针形，全缘，常脱落。质坚硬，断面略平坦，深绿色至棕色，有黄白色维管束513 个，环列，其外散有较多的叶迹维管束。气特异，味初淡而微涩，后渐苦、辛。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒。有小毒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，驱虫，止血。用于防止流感、虫积腹痛、崩漏 (用炭) 。\n【注解】\t“筋脉纹”：药材组织内的纤维或维管束。药材折断后，其纤维或维管束呈参差不齐的丝状，犹如身体的筋脉。在蒸汽的药材切面上所表现出的点状痕迹为“筋脉点”。较大的维管束痕也成为“筋脉纹”。"}]},{"ID":"20240206090559-7mgn1w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206090559-7mgn1w3","updated":"20240206090559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206090559-gexyns5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618113710-ihcxo6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618113710-ihcxo6x"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贯众2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贯众2-20240205155601-iwmmpww.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 425px;","style":"width: 415px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贯众3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贯众3-20240205155603-2e786gk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 415px;\" parent-style=\"width: 425px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618113718-epbnmvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618113718-epbnmvz","updated":"20240823135519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629154528-r1sfj0y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贯众"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贯众-20240205155600-mf2p9di.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText",